IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cdba-nouns`
IMPORT `cdba-calendar`
IMPORT `cdba-reg-compliance`

-- Tests for Regulations ss 32 to 34, with the working beside each assertion.

§ `Regulations s 32 -- tests`

-- An applicant, a beneficiary and a representative are bound by a properly served notice
-- naming a reasonable time, with or without a judge's authorization.
#ASSERT `the person is required to provide the information or document` `an applicant` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the person is required to provide the information or document` `a beneficiary` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the person is required to provide the information or document` `the representative of an applicant or beneficiary who is incapable of managing their own affairs` TRUE TRUE FALSE
-- Anyone else needs the judge's authorization, served together with the notice.
#ASSERT NOT `the person is required to provide the information or document` `any other person` TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT `the person is required to provide the information or document` `any other person` TRUE TRUE TRUE
-- A notice not served in the way the section allows, or with no reasonable time, binds nobody.
#ASSERT NOT `the person is required to provide the information or document` `an applicant` FALSE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the person is required to provide the information or document` `a beneficiary` TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the person is required to provide the information or document` `any other person` FALSE TRUE TRUE
-- 32(6): 15 days after service. Served 20 February 2026: 8 days of February left (28) = 28 February at +8, 15 days = 7 March 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for a review of the authorization` (YMD 2026 2 20) EQUALS YMD 2026 3 7
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for a review of the authorization` (YMD 2026 12 20) EQUALS YMD 2027 1 4

§ `Regulations s 34 -- tests`

#ASSERT `the person is required to be at a suitable place or available at a suitable time` `an applicant` TRUE
#ASSERT `the person is required to be at a suitable place or available at a suitable time` `a beneficiary` TRUE
#ASSERT `the person is required to be at a suitable place or available at a suitable time` `the representative of an applicant or beneficiary who is incapable of managing their own affairs` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person is required to be at a suitable place or available at a suitable time` `any other person` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the person is required to be at a suitable place or available at a suitable time` `an applicant` FALSE
